*2 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
*6 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
